            "line": 240,
            "text": "theorem correction_derivative_bound (P : Patch) (k : ℕ) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (c : Fin n → ℝ) (x : ℝ), |iteratedDeriv k (correction P c) x| ≤ C * ‖c‖"
